('Meeting a new classmate','Lina: Hello. Is this seat free?\nOmar: Yes, it is. Please sit here.\nLina: Thank you. My name is Lina. What is your name?\nOmar: I am Omar. I study engineering.\nLina: I study business. Are you from Bethlehem?\nOmar: No, I am from Ramallah. And you?\nLina: I am from Bethlehem. Nice to meet you.\nOmar: Nice to meet you too. Is this your first English class?', [('Where can Lina sit?',['In the free seat.','In a different classroom.','Outside the library.']),('What does Omar study?',['Engineering.','Business.','English literature.']),('Where is Lina from?',['Bethlehem.','Ramallah.','Nablus.'])], [('seat','A place for one person to sit.','مقعد'),('free','Not occupied in this conversation.','غير مشغول'),('study','Learn about a subject.','يدرس'),('first','Before the second.','الأول')], ['Is this seat free?','My name is…','Nice to meet you.'], 'book'),
('Daily routines','Omar: What time do you get up on class days?\nLina: I get up at seven. I have breakfast at half past seven.\nOmar: Do you walk to campus?\nLina: No. I take the bus at eight.\nOmar: When does your first class start?\nLina: At nine. I study in the library after class.\nOmar: Do you study there every day?\nLina: Usually. On Fridays I study at home.', [('When does Lina get up?',['At seven.','At half past seven.','At eight.']),('How does Lina travel to campus?',['By bus.','On foot.','By bicycle.']),('Where does she study on Fridays?',['At home.','On campus.','On the bus.'])], [('breakfast','The meal you eat in the morning.','فطور'),('campus','The buildings and grounds of a university.','حرم جامعي'),('usually','On most occasions.','عادةً'),('start','Begin.','يبدأ')], ['What time do you…?','I usually…','At half past…'], 'bus'),
('Talking about last weekend','Lina: Did you enjoy the student book fair on Saturday?\nOmar: Yes. I went with my cousin and bought two used books.\nLina: Were the books expensive?\nOmar: No. They cost less than the new editions. One was about photography.\nLina: That sounds interesting. Did you stay all afternoon?\nOmar: We left at three because my cousin had a family visit.\nLina: I missed the fair. I was helping my sister move.\nOmar: There is another one next month. We can go together.', [('Who went with Omar?',['His cousin.','His sister.','Lina.']),('Why did they leave at three?',['His cousin had a family visit.','The fair closed at three.','They could not find any books.']),('Why did Lina miss the fair?',['She was helping her sister move.','She was studying photography.','She had already bought the books.'])], [('fair','An event where people show or sell things.','معرض'),('used','Owned or used before.','مستعمل'),('edition','A particular version of a published book.','طبعة'),('miss','Fail to attend something.','يفوّت')], ['Did you enjoy…?','That sounds interesting.','We can go together.'], 'calendar'),
('Booking a journey','Omar: I would like two seats on the morning bus to Nablus, please.\nClerk: We have departures at eight and ten. Which one would you prefer?\nOmar: The eight o’clock bus. Does it stop near the university?\nClerk: Yes, but you need to tell the driver before you leave.\nOmar: How long does the journey usually take?\nClerk: About an hour and a half, depending on traffic.\nOmar: Can I change the booking if our class time changes?\nClerk: You can change it before six this evening. Keep your confirmation number.', [('Which departure does Omar choose?',['Eight o’clock.','Ten o’clock.','Six in the evening.']),('What must he do for the university stop?',['Tell the driver before leaving.','Buy a different ticket.','Change buses at the station.']),('What can affect the journey time?',['Traffic.','The confirmation number.','The number of classes.'])], [('departure','The time a journey begins.','مغادرة'),('prefer','Like one choice more than another.','يفضّل'),('depending on','Affected or decided by something else.','اعتماداً على'),('confirmation','A message showing that an arrangement is accepted.','تأكيد')], ['I would like…','Which one would you prefer?','Can I change the booking?'], 'bus'),
('Giving an opinion respectfully','Lina: I think our study group should meet twice a week before the exam.\nOmar: I see your point, but two long meetings may be difficult for students who work.\nLina: What if one meeting were online and only lasted thirty minutes?\nOmar: That would help. We could use it to ask questions rather than repeat the lecture.\nLina: Agreed. The campus meeting could focus on solving practice problems.\nOmar: We should ask everyone which evening works best before fixing a time.\nLina: I will send a short poll today. Could you prepare three practice problems?\nOmar: Yes. Then we can review the plan after the first week.', [('What concern does Omar raise?',['Working students may find two long meetings difficult.','The exam has been cancelled.','Nobody understands online meetings.']),('What is the purpose of the online meeting?',['To ask questions.','To repeat the whole lecture.','To choose a different course.']),('What will Lina do next?',['Send a poll.','Prepare three problems.','Cancel the campus meeting.'])], [('concern','Something that worries a person.','مصدر قلق'),('focus on','Give particular attention to.','يركّز على'),('poll','A short question used to collect people’s choices.','استطلاع'),('review','Look at something again to see whether it works.','يراجع')], ['I see your point, but…','What if we…?','We could…rather than…'], 'meeting'),
